---
import Icons from "./Icons.astro";
---

<section class="px-6 pb-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div
      class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border-2 border-neutral-100 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-electricBlue hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(37,99,235,0.25)] sm:p-10"
      data-reveal
    >
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-1 w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-electricBlue to-neonRed opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"
      />
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black sm:text-4xl">
        Is Your Athletic Department Act 810 Compliant?
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
        Federal NIL shifts and Louisiana's Act 810 mandate strict compliance. Read the full
        executive analysis to protect your program's eligibility, then bring me in to audit your
        music licensing and highlight workflows on campus. This work is education and brand
        strategy - not legal advice or athlete representation.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="/blog/trump-executive-order-college-sports-nil.html"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-black bg-black px-6 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-transparent hover:text-neonRed hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(239,68,68,0.6)]"
        >
          <Icons name="play" className="h-3.5 w-3.5 fill-current" />
          Read Policy Analysis
        </a>
        <a
          href="#contact-clinic"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-6 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-black transition-all duration-300 hover:border-electricBlue hover:text-electricBlue hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(37,99,235,0.4)]"
        >
          Host a Clinic at Your School
          <Icons name="arrow-right" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>